{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"2322630aa05db8519590d6dd01e288ae8b9f730ac0b03fd7f2255c7c8523d6ce"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:0e4b5f18850e3d3a8f8f9a4c17660c283c25735b761bcc479bfe5f3797a4b37d","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Various tricks and athletic abilities including water and land activities","evidence":"[D2:17 | 9:26 pm on 20 March, 2022] James: They can do tricks like sit, stay, paw, and rollover. Here's a picture of Daisy waiting for a treat. I've done lots of training and they've picked it up fast. They're like my family.\n[D14:17 | 5:07 pm on 16 June, 2022] James: Yeah, he loves it! We usually hit the beach or lake, and he loves playing in the water. He's a pro swimmer!\n[D14:23 | 5:07 pm on 16 June, 2022] James: Max is a real go-getter! He's awesome at catching frisbees in mid-air - never misses!\n[D17:16 | 9:49 am on 22 July, 2022] James: Indeed, I remember this moment. We loved skateboards back then, sometimes we even left class early to do it. I still like to go for a ride sometimes, and I even taught my dogs how to balance on it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:213daf3e-5e39-5180-94f5-60a11e495145","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:547f708aebb4dfd22ae8fdd4d02e57198ff9252bee21f8f98f4e17033acab25f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of tricks do James's pets know?","referenceAnswer":"swimming, catching frisbees, balancing on a skateboard, sit, stay, paw, and rollover","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"547f708aebb4dfd22ae8fdd4d02e57198ff9252bee21f8f98f4e17033acab25f"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}